        <div class="container">
            <div class="d-flex d-xl-flex justify-content-center align-items-center" style="margin-top: 0px;padding-top: 16px;">
                <h1 style="margin-top: 0px;color: #221a4a;border-radius: 21px;width: 11em;font-weight: bold;border-style: none;margin-bottom: -5px;text-align: center;">EVENTO DESTACADO</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="d-flex d-xl-flex justify-content-center align-items-center" style="margin-top: 0px;padding-top: 0px;padding-bottom: 20px;">
                <p style="color: #221a4a;font-size: 14px;text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;width: 80%;padding-top: 14px;font-weight: bold;">Conoce nuestros eventos y deja que el arte transforme tu vida.</p>
            </div>
            <div style="border-left-style: none;">
                <div class="row" style="background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.71) -64%, rgba(0,0,0,0.77)), url(&quot;assets/img/fondo-agenda-1.jpg&quot;);">
                    <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-xl-6 col-xxl-6" style="padding: 20px;padding-top: 20px;padding-bottom: 20px;border-color: var(--swiper-theme-color);border-right-style: none;padding-right: 20px;">
                        <div class="row" style="border: 1px none var(--bs-success) ;border-right-style: none;">
                            <div class="col-12" style="padding-top: 12px;border-left-style: none;">
                                <div class="d-flex d-xl-flex justify-content-start align-items-center" style="margin-top: 0px;padding-top: 0;">
                                    <h1 style="margin-top: 0px;border-radius: 0;width: 3em;font-weight: bold;text-align: center;background: var(--bs-secondary);color: #000000;">2026</h1>
                                    <h1 class="d-flex" style="margin-top: 0px;color: #000000;border-radius: 0;width: 100%;font-weight: bold;background: var(--bs-white);border-style: none;border-bottom-right-radius: 20px;border-top-right-radius: 20px;font-size: 11px;padding: 13px;letter-spacing: 7px;">Artes para la Paz</h1>
                                </div>
                                <div class="d-flex d-xl-flex justify-content-center" style="margin-top: 0px;padding-top: 0px;width: 100%;">
                                    <h4 style="font-weight: bold;color: var(--bs-primary);font-size: 2.5em;text-align: center;width: 80%;margin-bottom: 0px;">2026</h4>
