    <section id="videos" style="background: #221a4a;padding-bottom: 35px;padding-top: 90px;margin-top: 0;">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="d-flex d-xl-flex justify-content-center align-items-center" style="margin-top: 0px;padding-top: 16px;">
                <h1 style="margin-top: 0px;color: var(--bs-white);border-radius: 0;width: 4.5em;font-weight: bold;text-align: center;">VIDEOS</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="d-flex d-xl-flex justify-content-center align-items-center" style="margin-top: 0px;padding-top: 0px;padding-bottom: 20px;">
                <p style="color: var(--bs-white);font-size: 14px;text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;width: 80%;padding-top: 14px;font-weight: bold;">Descubre historias sobre cómo estamos transformando la cultura en Colombia, de un privilegio de pocos a un derecho de todos.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="row gy-4">
                <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-xl-6" style="border-style: none;">
                    <h1>Artes para la Paz</h1>
                    <div class="card" style="margin-right: 5px;margin-left: 5px;background: var(--bs-secondary);color: var(--bs-primary);border-style: none;"><iframe allowfullscreen="" frameborder="0" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/1px8dc0Kw_Y" width="100%"></iframe>
                        <div class="card-body" style="background: var(--bs-secondary);border-style: none;">
                            <h4 class="card-title" style="color: var(--bs-primary);font-size: 14px;margin-bottom: 0px;">Conoce el programa Artes para la Paz</h4>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
